    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f Buckle up. Boot up. Your waifu's driving the tank.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In My Waifu Is A Tank Girl!, you're not just entering the battlefield \u2014 you're rolling into it inside a steel beast crewed by elite anime girls with big guns, sharper instincts, and way too much energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They\u2019re cute. They\u2019re deadly. And they\u2019ve got beef with the other side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You? You're the commander. Your job: blast everything that moves and make your waifu crew proud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No plot. No mercy. Just pure, chaotic, waifu-fueled tank mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udca5 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-speed arena battles with anime-girl tank crews</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your side and unleash shell-shocking firepower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heavily armed tanks. Minimal logic. Maximum fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute voices, big explosions, and non-stop action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to pick up, hard to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable CG gallery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
